meta {
  name: Get Milestones
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/milestones
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Milestones
  Fetch the roadmap of milestones, deliverables, and completion status.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Milestones returned.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  [
    {
      "id": "mls_1",
      "title": "Complete MVP Beta Launch in Chennai",
      "dueDate": "2026-12-15",
      "completed": true,
      "startupId": "stp_101",
      "rewardBudgetINR": 500000
    }
  ]
  ```
}
